  "description": "A bright and spacious two-bedroom first-floor apartment situated within the well-maintained, gated development of Moathill Manor, featuring attractive communal areas.\n\nThe property is conveniently located opposite Our Lady’s Hospital and within easy walking distance of Navan Town Centre, Páirc Tailteann GAA Stadium, Navan Retail Park, and St Patrick’s Classical School. The property also offers excellent access to the M3 motorway and the N51, making it an ideal choice for commuters.\n\nNavan Town Centre is within easy walking distance and offers an extensive range of amenities, including a variety of primary and secondary schools, shopping centres, cafés, restaurants, traditional public houses, and local services. The Meath Arts Centre provides a diverse programme of entertainment and cultural activities, including art exhibitions, musicals, drama, film screenings, and comedy performances.\n\nFor those interested in sport and recreation, Navan offers a wide range of sporting clubs and facilities, including GAA, soccer, rugby, and tennis. Navan Racecourse is also located nearby.\n\nDublin is within convenient commuting distance via the M3 motorway. Dunboyne Railway Station provides an excellent Park & Ride facility, while Bus Éireann operates a frequent commuter service to Dublin City Centre.\n\nTo arrange a viewing, please email to express your interest via accounts@fisherproperty.ie only. No phone calls.",
